# ==================================================================================================
# Range limits at every width
# For each width at the tier boundaries (1, 2, 4 | 5, 9 | 10, 18 | 19, 38) and for scale 0, scale w/2 and
# scale w: the largest and smallest representable value, and the first value beyond each (10^(w-scale)).
# ==================================================================================================

