# ==================================================================================================
# Negative exponent with scale equal to the width (issue #29189)
# The reported bug: CAST('1e-5' AS DECIMAL(5,5)). DECIMAL(w,w) has no room for an integer digit, so the mantissa
# digit is rejected before the exponent is known. Every tier boundary, both signs, and values that round to one
# unit in the last place or to zero.
# ==================================================================================================

