# ==================================================================================================
# Exponent: values that are out of range once the exponent is applied
# The width check has to happen after the exponent is applied, and it must still reject values that do not
# fit. This includes a round-up that carries to +-1.0, and inputs that fill the physical type completely
# (the digit that decides the rounding cannot be stored, so these must not be accepted).
# ==================================================================================================

